[{"id":102889,"name":"Uoga Uoga, Lip Scrub &#8211; Sugarmatcha (10 ml)","slug":"uoga-uoga-lip-scrub-sugarmatcha-10-ml","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/organature.bh\/product\/uoga-uoga-lip-scrub-sugarmatcha-10-ml\/","sku":"SN19151","short_description":"<p>\u2022 Gently exfoliates<br \/>\n\u2022 Softens and moisturises<br \/>\n\u2022 Matcha protects against oxidative stress<br \/>\n\u2022 Free from microplastics<br \/>\n\u2022 100% natural<br \/>\n\u2022 Vegan<\/p>","description":"<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div id=\"collapseLearnMore\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse in\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingLearnMore\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Thanks to its lip-loving consistency and special ingredients, this scrub not only exfoliates but moisturises your lips too. The Japanese matcha tea brings additional detox properties to the mix.<\/p>\n<p>Cellulose and sugar remove dead cells while also softening the exfoliating effect. Shea butter, castor and jojoba oils nourish and hydrate lips. Delightfully cooling, this aroma goes well with our Matchaberry lip balm.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div id=\"headingUsage\" class=\"panel-heading\" role=\"tab\">\n<p class=\"panel-title\"><strong>How to use it<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Apply a small amount and gently massage into your lips \u2013 emphasis on the word \u201cgently\u201d. Afterwards remove any residue with your finger or a damp cloth. Can be used 3-4 times a week.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div id=\"headingIngredients\" class=\"panel-heading\" role=\"tab\">\n<h4 class=\"panel-title\">Ingredients<\/h4>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div id=\"collapseIngredients\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse in\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingIngredients\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Ricinus Communis (castor) Seed Oil*, Simmondsia Chinensis (jojoba) Seed Oil*, Glyceryl Rosinate, Euphorbia Cerifera (candelilla) Wax, Helianthus Annuus (sunflower) Seed Wax, Cellulose, Octyldodecanol, Butyrospermum Parkii (shea) Butter*, Tocopherol (vitamin E), Camellia Sinensis (matcha) Powder*, Helianthus Annuus (sunflower) Seed Oil, Sucrose (sugar)*<span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"1\">,\u00a0<\/span>Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Olea Europaea (olive) Fruit Oil, Citrus Limon (lemon) Peel Oil, Mentha Arvensis (corn mint) Leaf Oil*, Mentha Spicata (spearmint) Herb Oil*, Carvone**, Citral**, Limonene**, Menthol**, Pinene**. *From organic agriculture. **Naturally occurring in essential oils. 73% organic of total. 100% natural origin of total.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div id=\"headingFitsTogether\" class=\"panel-heading\" role=\"tab\">\n<h4 class=\"panel-title\"><\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"6000","regular_price":"6000","sale_price":"6000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"BHD","currency_symbol":"BHD","currency_minor_unit":3,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" BHD"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi>6.000&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">BHD<\/span><\/bdi><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":102890,"src":"https:\/\/organature.bh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Untitled-design-2026-06-16T194127.288.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/organature.bh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Untitled-design-2026-06-16T194127.288-600x600.png","srcset":"https:\/\/organature.bh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Untitled-design-2026-06-16T194127.288.png 2000w, https:\/\/organature.bh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Untitled-design-2026-06-16T194127.288-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/organature.bh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Untitled-design-2026-06-16T194127.288-1024x1024.png 1024w,